bb_tag\" >Escape the overwork hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape from Endless Solutions, you must find clues that will give you access to new areas and reveal new secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find all the numbers and collect the story-related items?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/06580c2aa8fa09323f3991979b24ab51.poster.avif?t=1755096856\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/06580c2aa8fa09323f3991979b24ab51.webm?t=1755096856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you escape?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Story based anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Anomalies in total</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Working hours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~1-2 hours (+overtime)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/8db5246ac3b4e5ff3aa4a00ac629dc53.poster.avif?t=1755096856\" width=798 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/8db5246ac3b4e5ff3aa4a00ac629dc53.webm?t=1755096856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/8db5246ac3b4e5ff3aa4a00ac629dc53.mp4?t=1755096856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
